{"suttaId":"tha-ap528","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3579,3597],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap528:0.3":"Daṇḍadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap528:1.1":"“Kānanaṃ vanamogayha, veḷuṃ chetvānahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap528:1.3":"Ālambaṇaṃ karitvāna, saṅghassa adadiṃ bahuṃ [ahaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)].","tha-ap528:2.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, subbate abhivādiya;","tha-ap528:2.3":"Ālambadaṇḍaṃ datvāna, pakkāmiṃ uttarāmukho.","tha-ap528:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ daṇḍamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap528:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, daṇḍadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap528:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap528:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap528:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap528:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā daṇḍadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap528:8.1":"Daṇḍadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ.","tha-ap528:8.2":"Tevīsatimaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
